  "formal": {
    "project": "research/hasse_norm_recurrence_audit_20261114/lean",
    "theorem": "HasseNormRecurrenceAudit.hasse_norm_recurrence_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem hasse_norm_recurrence_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (A B : Polynomial K) (σ : K →+* K) (M n : ℕ), 0 < M → A.natDegree < 2 * M - 1 → (A * (expand K M B).map σ).coeff (M * n + (M - 1)) = A.coeff (M - 1) * σ (B.coeff n)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (p : ℕ) [Fact (Nat.Prime p)] [CharP K p], p ≠ 2 → ∀ f : Polynomial K, f.natDegree ≤ 3 → ∀ r : ℕ, coefficientAt f (p ^ (r + 1)) = coefficientAt f (p ^ r) * coefficientAt f p ^ (p ^ r) ∧ coefficientAt f (p ^ r) = coefficientAt f p ^ (∑ i ∈ range r, p ^ i) ∧ (0 < r → (coefficientAt f (p ^ r) = 0 ↔ coefficientAt f p = 0))) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [Fintype K] [DecidableEq K] (p : ℕ) [Fact (Nat.Prime p)] [CharP K p], p ≠ 2 → ∀ r : ℕ, 0 < r → Fintype.card K = p ^ r → ∀ a b c : K, (cubicModel a b c).Δ ≠ 0 → (SupersingularTraceClassesAudit.fieldTrace (cubicModel a b c) : K) = coefficientAt (cubicPolynomial a b c) p ^ (∑ i ∈ range r, p ^ i) ∧ ((p : ℤ) ∣ SupersingularTraceClassesAudit.fieldTrace (cubicModel a b c) ↔ coefficientAt (cubicPolynomial a b c) p = 0)) ∧ (coefficientAt (X ^ 3 : Polynomial (ZMod 2)) 2 = 0 ∧ coefficientAt (X ^ 3 : Polynomial (ZMod 2)) 4 = 1) ∧ (¬∀ f : Polynomial (ZMod 2), f.natDegree ≤ 3 → coefficientAt f (2 ^ (1 + 1)) = coefficientAt f (2 ^ 1) * coefficientAt f 2 ^ (2 ^ 1)) ∧ (¬∀ f : Polynomial (ZMod 3), f.natDegree ≤ 3 → (coefficientAt f (3 ^ 0) = 0 ↔ coefficientAt f 3 = 0)) ∧ (coefficientAt (X + X ^ 5 : Polynomial (ZMod 3)) 3 = 0 ∧ coefficientAt (X + X ^ 5 : Polynomial (ZMod 3)) 9 = 1) ∧ (¬∀ f : Polynomial (ZMod 3), coefficientAt f (3 ^ (1 + 1)) = coefficientAt f (3 ^ 1) * coefficientAt f 3 ^ (3 ^ 1)) ∧ (∃ a : F9, (cubicModel a 0 1).Δ ≠ 0 ∧ coefficientAt (cubicPolynomial a 0 1) 3 = a ∧ coefficientAt (cubicPolynomial a 0 1) 9 = a ^ 4 ∧ a ^ 4 = 1 ∧ (SupersingularTraceClassesAudit.fieldTrace (cubicModel a 0 1) : F9) = a ^ 4 ∧ coefficientAt (cubicPolynomial a 0 1) 3 ≠ coefficientAt (cubicPolynomial a 0 1) 9)",
    "decl_sha256": "5f1d5ed1fd33903abc4af64d7cb205336f82ae131aba8ccf43ba159f9c8daa39",
    "scope": "Actual Hasse primepower coefficient recurrence and explicit Frobenius product. For every oddprime p, every field of characteristic p, actual polynomial f of degree≤3 and all r≥0, derive H_(p^(r+1))=H_(p^r)*Hp^(p^r), and H_(p^r)=Hp^(sum_i<r p^i). For r>0 derive H_(p^r)=0 iff Hp=0. Actual polynomial coefficients, actual sparse product convolution, proved halfpower degree bound and official actual iterateFrobenius supply the proof, no coefficient recurrence conclusion premise. For finite K of cardinalityp^r and actual nonsingular moniccubic Mathlib E, derive actual count-defined integertrace cast=explicit Hp product and, forr>0, actual pdivisibility iff Hpzero via unchanged actual Point-count coefficient bridge. Actual nonsingular F9curve has Hp=a, H9=a^4=1=actualtracecast yet Hp differs fromH9, confirming correct source norm relation. Literal F2X^3 oddcharacteristic deletion, F3X^3 r0vanishing deletion and F3X+X^5 arbitrarydegree recurrence are directly negated. Controls are polynomialguard examples, not fullnonsingularcurve supersingularity counterexamples; degree3sufficiency not claimed sharp. Known MIT2019PS4Problem1g classicalmethod credited, no novelty/qualifiedsource refutation. Does not construct canonical Algebra.norm/Frobenius-endomorphism categoricaltrace, prove general Hassebound/geometricSS/p-rank/fulltorsionfield/qualifiedintegercountrecovery beyond13. Native header parsing/hash processing procedural, not kernel parser/hash/physicalhost refinement. Prior proof/artifact/claim bytes unchanged. No holes/customaxioms/nativeproofevaluation/limits/globalflags/waivers/newcryptoexperiment/spend/upload.",
